  m_Name: SCP500Info
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ItemNumber: SCP-500
  Description: SCP-500 is a small plastic can which at the time of writing contains
    forty-seven (47) red pills. One pill, when taken orally, effectively cures the
    subject of all diseases within two hours, exact time depending on the severity
    and amount of the subject's conditions. Despite extensive trials, all attempts
    at synthesizing more of what is thought to be the active ingredient of the pills
    have been unsuccessful.
